{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a hostile alien world, your only hope is to fight, build, and gather enough </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>bioshards</strong> to power your ship before time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a race against the clock\u2014survive waves of vicious creatures, secure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > vital resources, and decide whether to escape with what you\u2019ve earned or push deeper </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for greater rewards. In <i>Planet Extincter</i>, every choice matters, and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/2b981d2db69a8bd140ea21995f6f01ee.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=242 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across alien worlds, each with its own challenges, creatures, and treasures. Some biom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >es hide enemy nests or dangerous cocoons, while others hold challenge zones filled with high </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >risks and greater rewards. Along the way you\u2019ll mine essential resources\u2014<strong>gold, coal, bronze, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and iron</strong>\u2014each one fueling your growth and survival. Every biome feels different, with unique </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >monsters that fight in their own ways. Where you go, and what you take from these worlds, is </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >always up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/aa6953a0a200dbe147f1c0fa8727cd17.poster.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/aa6953a0a200dbe147f1c0fa8727cd17.webm?t=1760302109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/aa6953a0a200dbe147f1c0fa8727cd17.mp4?t=1760302109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/5b4bc2e113d51adb18cf5f78fbcf1ae6.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=248 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather critical resources such as iron, uranium, and crude oil to fuel your expansion. Construct </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mining outposts, energy grids, ammo factories, and powerful turrets to secure your foothold on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hostile planets. Every base is a reflection of your strategy\u2014will you prioritize strong defenses, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rapid production, or exploration speed? Walls and fortifications may buy you time, but the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enemy never stops adapting. The way you design your outposts will determine whether you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >thrive or fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/9bdb8c07339994dd13869c56ba924acb.poster.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/9bdb8c07339994dd13869c56ba924acb.webm?t=1760302109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/9bdb8c07339994dd13869c56ba924acb.mp4?t=1760302109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/321195e37ba0580f8a480669083ad3a9.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition ends with a choice. Do you head back to your ship and escape with the loot </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you\u2019ve gathered, or gamble everything by staying longer? Push deeper into hostile territory to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destroy enemy bases, clear nests, and claim rare rewards\u2014but every minute you remain, the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >danger grows. One wrong move, and everything you\u2019ve earned could be lost forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/fa0c3df2c1e09025591097a25b2abf5a.poster.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/fa0c3df2c1e09025591097a25b2abf5a.webm?t=1760302109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/fa0c3df2c1e09025591097a25b2abf5a.mp4?t=1760302109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/extras/e977d8969afc9d145bfc82c15c7f3b76.avif?t=1760302109\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, you\u2019ll get an early look at the Research Tree\u2014experimenting with a few key </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrades and technologies to see how progression shapes your playstyle. While it\u2019s not fully </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlocked in this demo, it gives you a glimpse of how future research will expand your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and options across the galaxy. Each expedition is a choice: extract safely with your loot, or </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >push deeper and risk it all for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799630?t=1760302109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799630?t=1760302109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/dbf7551c9a566dd71c350bfd70c1bae37036970d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760302109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799630/dbf7551c9a566dd71c350bfd70c1bae37036970d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760302109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a hostile alien world, your only hope is to fight, build, and gather enough </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>bioshards</strong> to power your ship befo